istianity and the evils perpetrated by Christians at the link I gave you above. It is even WORSE than what he has to say about Judaism.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I mentioned before on this blog the instance of the soldier in Iraq who was torturing an Iraqi, and when the Iraqi asked, &amp;quot;Why are you doing this to me?&amp;quot; the soldier replied, &amp;quot;So you will know the love of Jesus.&amp;quot; That turns MY stomach. I can&amp;#39;t imagine what effect it would have on a Muslim.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;CONCLUSION: Before we condemn all the people of the Jewish Race, we should rather expose the evil tenets of their religion with which so many of them have been brainwashed, just as people have exposed the evil tenets to be found scattered in the Koran, and the evil tenets to be found in many of the writings of Christan &amp;#39;leaders&amp;#39; down through the centuries. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;IT IS NOT A RACIAL QUESTION, but a question of True Believers of ALL religions, who consider &amp;quot;The Others&amp;quot; of other religions, or races, as mere animals to be exterminated, or sub-humans to be robbed, murdered, tortured, and exploited like cattle. (And Nationalism, Socialism, Fascism, or Republicanism can be religions, too.) &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Can you see that?&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - Lemuel Gulliver.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/5929420671894166984'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/5929420671894166984'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1293002096425#c5929420671894166984' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='ht