hese blue-clad, paramilitarily-outfitted dregs of society you describe are the enforcement arm of those overlords.  They are creatures who are either devoid of any ability to contribute anything useful to a free (and free market) society, who are too anti-social to fit in among communities of decent and honest human beings, or whose indolence is simply too deeply entrenched to enable them to face life like real men (and sadly, there are some women amongst them too) and forge their own way in the world in a manner that doesn&amp;#39;t involve acts of theft and assault against their fellow man.  &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The only possibility of a silver lining to this very dark cloud is to awaken as many of the sheeple as possible, to make them see what is happening in front of them in plain sight, to disabuse them of the myths that have been force-fed to them by their own brainwashed forebears and reinforced by twelve-plus years of systemic torture in government indoctrination centers.  Then AND ONLY THEN will this unearned respect for &amp;quot;authoritah&amp;quot; evaporate and these blue-clad gangsters begin to be treated like the criminal &amp;quot;enemy combatants&amp;quot; that they are!</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/4875439584932858848'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/4875439584932858848'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292947936568#c4875439584932858848' title=''/><author><name>liberranter</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/00555275410576294081</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns: