e='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-445471654"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 11:55 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1738313338163374717</id><published>2010-12-20T11:18:59.264-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T11:18:59.264-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Informative article, Will. I do have to ask though...</title><content type='html'>Informative article, Will. I do have to ask though if these marked DHS vehicles are more &amp;quot;prominent&amp;quot; or more commonly seen out West because I haven&amp;#39;t seen any marked DHS vehicles in my area. Now, I know there are plenty of unmarked cars from many agencies, local, state, and the Feds, but I&amp;#39;m talkin&amp;#39; specifically about these plainly marked DHS vehicles.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The unfortunate reality is that folk who are continually lamenting the troublesome and, indeed, often lethal Leviathan don&amp;#39;t (or rarely) take into account the fact that the &lt;i&gt;the people&lt;/i&gt; themselves are their/our own worst enemy.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;As MoT touched upon above, Leviathan would be virtually powerless over the populace were it not for the army of &lt;i&gt;willing&lt;/i&gt; informants, snitches, and other &amp;quot;anonymous&amp;quot; crows and buzzards that plague every community these days. I&amp;#39;d bet there are more snitches, informants, crows and buzzards today than at any time in the past, even during wars of yore. That&amp;#39;s how low-down many &lt;i&gt;regular folk&lt;/i&gt; have sunk. They report on those that they either don&amp;#39;t like outright, or they merely presume one to be breaking a Almighty State mandate by virtue of ones non-conformity or association with a group collective or what I call &amp;quot;the flow.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The statists amongst the run-of-the-mill peons are what REALLY provide Leviathan with its true power. I&amp;#39;m sure Mr. Cerchione has plenty of dependable and reliable (and &lt;i&gt;damned&lt;/i&gt;) mundanes in the Boise area (as anywhere) who wouldn&amp;#39;t hesitate to anonymously feed him info about other folk, given a &amp;quot;rewarding&amp;quot; opportunity to do so.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Lastly, as should be clear even to the blind by now, the heavy hands of Leviathan(s) are about to hug the Internet snugly....ugh.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/1738313338163374717'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/1738313338163374717'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292869139264#c1738313338163374717' title=''/><author><name>dixiedog</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09845646940134894119</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='31' src='http://1.bp.blogspot.com/_Zqy-qAblsH8/TL5zxbhvgvI/AAAAAAAAAF8/OmF8jz2rkII/S220/dixiedog.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-504942784"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 11:18 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1156441881166184583</id><published>2010-12-20T10:49:48.413-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T10:49:48.413-07:00</updated><title type='text'>First time here. Found your article on LewRockwell...</title><content type='html'>First time here. Found your article on LewRockwell. I&amp;#39;m now following your blog. Keep up the good work. I&amp;#39;d be honored if you left a comment at my blog http://myuncivildisobedience.blogspot.com/&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Either way, thanks for what you do.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/1156441881166184583'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/1156441881166184583'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292867388413#c1156441881166184583' title=''/><author><name>JpKnowMad</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/09396603917758350102</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='20' src='http://2.bp.blogspot.com/_gfIxg875CR4/TQxSpfK6x_I/AAAAAAAAAAQ/aISRAfywyqc/S220/Firefox_wallpaper.png'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1269636686"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 10:49 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4124604845870805047</id><published>2010-12-20T09:48:05.254-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T09:48:05.254-07:00</updated><title type='text'>So the Chekists are &amp;quot;working&amp;quot; the Boise ...</title><content type='html'>So the Chekists are &amp;quot;working&amp;quot; the Boise area, eh?  People too content, peaceful, or going about productive pursuits?  Not enough strife to suit them?&lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;I remember, back in 2003, how the TSA, the DHS by extension, appeared so comical and inept (not that it changed) and over the years has become more belligerent.  That the DHS would become more intrusive comes as little surprise.  It was during a swing through the Big Bend area of Texas that I passed through Alpine and &amp;quot;LO&amp;quot;... Big bright shiny new buildings and a surprising amount of DHS goings on for what once was such a sleepy town.  Today?  Who knows.  My money, and certainly everyone else, has been spent on further mischief by these thieves and liars.  All to build their little ivory towers at our expense.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;I&amp;#39;m reminded of something I read where it was pointed out that the Gestapo didn&amp;#39;t have the manpower to spy on everyone but it was the ordinary &amp;quot;patriotic&amp;quot; German who turned in his fellow man for things as base as seeing themselves get a promotion or destroying suitors for their love interests.  Think it impossible today?  Not in the least.  People are people and evil doesn&amp;#39;t parse what nation you&amp;#39;re from before acting.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/4124604845870805047'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/4124604845870805047'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292863685254#c4124604845870805047' title=''/><author><name>MoT</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/13996714804361467430</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='32' height='23' src='http://bp3.blogger.com/_RPImowXMSuQ/SBjAjbSgPQI/AAAAAAAAABA/THgfv851ckU/S220/amsoc.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-388975791"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 9:48 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-1301808342032299890</id><published>2010-12-20T07:22:07.361-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T07:22:07.361-07:00</updated><title type='text'>The United Regions of America.</title><content type='html'>The United Regions of America.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/1301808342032299890'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/1301808342032299890'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292854927361#c1301808342032299890' title=''/><author><name>castiron</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1741465295"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 7:22 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6086418931513183535</id><published>2010-12-20T07:15:33.665-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T07:15:33.665-07:00</updated><title type='text'>When is it time for the filthy maggot pigs to rot ...</title><content type='html'>When is it time for the filthy maggot pigs to rot in hell for what they&amp;#39;ve done to this country?</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/6086418931513183535'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/6086418931513183535'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292854533665#c6086418931513183535' title=''/><author><name>Mark Matis</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1443605337"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 7:15 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-496601207839056084</id><published>2010-12-20T03:06:08.752-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T03:06:08.752-07:00</updated><title type='text'>Maybe there is some truth that ex-Stasi did in fac...</title><content type='html'>Maybe there is some truth that ex-Stasi did in fact help create the DHS. Worth looking into.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/496601207839056084'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/496601207839056084'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292839568752#c496601207839056084' title=''/><author><name>Anonymous</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1963753748"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 20, 2010 at 3:06 AM"/></entry><entry><id>tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-4288697739529976201</id><published>2010-12-20T01:30:33.741-07:00</published><updated>2010-12-20T01:30:33.741-07:00</updated><title type='text'>&amp;quot;Mr. Cerchione.... wasn&amp;#39;t there to keep P...</title><content type='html'>&amp;quot;Mr. Cerchione.... wasn&amp;#39;t there to keep Paul and his fellow members of the productive class &amp;quot;safe&amp;quot;; he was there to surveil them as potential threats to the safety of the tax-consuming class.&amp;quot;&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Grigg, never did you say a truer word. The entire apparatus of the Federal Protective Service and its various Directorates is there not to protect US from terrorists, but to protect the Government, and its owners, the 1% of the richest people in America, (who own 40% of the corporate stock and other assets of this nation) and those corporations, and their top executives, FROM US. &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;For example, this news: &amp;quot;Vice President Joe Biden confirmed on Meet the Press this Sunday that he and the White House agree with Mitch McConnell&amp;#39;s assessment that Julian Assange is a &amp;quot;high tech terrorist.&amp;quot; &lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Mr. Grigg, are you &amp;#39;terrified&amp;#39; of Julian Assange? Liberranter, are you &amp;#39;terrified&amp;#39; of Julian Assange? MoT, are you &amp;#39;terrified&amp;#39; of Julian Assange? ANYONE out there reading this, are you &amp;#39;terrified&amp;#39; of Julian Assange? Ah so. Me neither.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;The only people terrified of Julian Assange are the lying, fucking sacks of shit who pose as our &amp;#39;leaders&amp;#39; and their Directorates of their &amp;#39;Federal Protective Services.&amp;#39; They try to organize every fucking iota of our lives so they can continue to rob us blind. To steal our jobs, our houses, and our savings, murder our children and our wives and husbands, to throw us in jail and torture us, unless we meekly hand over the fruits of our blood, sweat and tears. Every last shekel. They want it ALL.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;At least Bonnie Parker and Clyde Barrow, and all other highway robbers in history, just shot their non-compliant victims. They did not render them to dank prisons in Bulgaria or Egypt, to have their genitals electrocuted and their fingers broken, to be frozen, or cooked, or drowned, to death. Literally HUNDREDS of prisoners of the Leviathan State have been murdered under &amp;#39;interrogation&amp;#39; in this way.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Just wait, sheeple. Say nothing. Do nothing. Believe everything they tell you. It&amp;#39;s not your problem. Sleep easy. Arbeit Macht Frei. BAD NEWS: Soon it will be your turn. Soon the Reichssicherheitshauptamt will come for you, and there will be nobody left to speak out for you.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;There is a monstrous evil of immense proportions afoot in this world, headquartered in these United States, where there is more power and money available to steal than anywhere else on the planet, and in all the millenia of history. It is so black, filthy, stinking and vile, the average human being cannot begin to imagine it. &lt;br /&gt; &lt;br /&gt;Neither can most of the people who serve this Creature. Most of them, like Mark Cerchione, Joe Biden, Barack Obama, and all the foul scumbags sitting on Capitol Hill, have no idea of the horror, the vileness, the monstrous evil of The Beast they serve.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;But serve it they do.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt; - Lemuel Gulliver.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;PS: Please excuse my language. It is the only way I can begin to say how I feel. Be glad I made an effort to control myself.</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/4288697739529976201'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/4288697739529976201'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292833833741#c4288697739529976201' title=''/><author><name>Lemuel Gulliver</name><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/blank.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1824226115"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTim