stapo in Boise.&lt;br /&gt;&lt;br /&gt;Bob&lt;br /&gt;III</content><link rel='edit' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/8459762468974950434'/><link rel='self' type='application/atom+xml' href='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/6242328512856176635/comments/default/8459762468974950434'/><link rel='alternate' type='text/html' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html?showComment=1292763148145#c8459762468974950434' title=''/><author><name>idahobob</name><uri>http://www.blogger.com/profile/12857771751176894988</uri><email>noreply@blogger.com</email><gd:image rel='http://schemas.google.com/g/2005#thumbnail' width='16' height='16' src='http://img1.blogblog.com/img/b16-rounded.gif'/></author><thr:in-reply-to xmlns:thr='http://purl.org/syndication/thread/1.0' href='http://freedominourtime.blogspot.com/2010/12/just-keeping-you-safe-cheka-checks-in.html' ref='tag:blogger.com,1999:blog-32869165.post-6242328512856176635' source='http://www.blogger.com/feeds/32869165/posts/default/6242328512856176635' type='text/html'/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.itemClass" value="pid-1127647954"/><gd:extendedProperty name="blogger.displayTime" value="December 19, 2010 at 5:52 AM"/></entry></feed>